# Folds 0-4 of the ctp-only rCBF model (ctp_only_plan.md §18), on the H100 box. Each node is
# condor/ctp_only_train_h100.sub with target=rcbf, fold=k and mode=full: about 20 h each.
# Results land in /radraid2/colivares/mrdpm_ctp_only/runs/train_ctp_only_f13_rcbf_fold<k>_<date_time>/.
#
# First, once: stage rCBF on the box (ctp_only_stage_home.sub -append 'target = rcbf') and pass
# an rCBF debug run (ctp_only_train_h100.sub -append 'target = rcbf').
#
#   cd /raid/colivares/github_repos/MRDPM-with-RAP_fork && git pull
#   condor_q -run          # this account may hold 3 GPUs at once; going over gets jobs booted
#   cd condor && mkdir -p log && condor_submit_dag ctp_only_rcbf_folds.dag
#   condor_q -dag
#   tail -f ctp_only_rcbf_folds.dag.dagman.out
#
# HOW MANY AT ONCE
# MAXJOBS h100 1 runs one fold at a time: about 4 days for the five. MAXJOBS counts only this
# DAG's jobs. Count yours before raising it: Tmax fold 0 (submitted on its own) and the Tmax
# folds' DAG (ctp_only_folds_1_4.dag, 1 at a time) each hold a GPU while they run, so with this
# DAG at 1 the account holds 3, its cap. 2 here (about 2.5 days) fits only once both of those are
# down to one GPU between them. `condor_submit_dag -maxjobs N` can only lower it, so edit the
# line below.
#
# NO RETRY, as in ctp_only_folds_1_4.dag: a retried node would restart its fold from epoch 0. If
# a node fails, DAGMan finishes the others and writes ctp_only_rcbf_folds.dag.rescue001. Resume
# that fold by hand from its last checkpoint on /radraid2 (ctp_only_train_h100.sub's header,
# with -append 'target = rcbf'), or fix the cause and run the same condor_submit_dag again.

JOB      RCBF0  ctp_only_train_h100.sub
VARS     RCBF0  fold="0" mode="full" target="rcbf"
CATEGORY RCBF0  h100

JOB      RCBF1  ctp_only_train_h100.sub
VARS     RCBF1  fold="1" mode="full" target="rcbf"
CATEGORY RCBF1  h100

JOB      RCBF2  ctp_only_train_h100.sub
VARS     RCBF2  fold="2" mode="full" target="rcbf"
CATEGORY RCBF2  h100

JOB      RCBF3  ctp_only_train_h100.sub
VARS     RCBF3  fold="3" mode="full" target="rcbf"
CATEGORY RCBF3  h100

JOB      RCBF4  ctp_only_train_h100.sub
VARS     RCBF4  fold="4" mode="full" target="rcbf"
CATEGORY RCBF4  h100

MAXJOBS  h100  1
